WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.050
"I can't wait to fly in an airplane!" Harry said.

2
00:00:07.051 --> 00:00:11.618
"Flying sounds scary," Oliver said.

3
00:00:11.619 --> 00:00:15.541
"It will be fun!" Dad said.

4
00:00:15.542 --> 00:00:21.498
Lots of people got on the plane.

5
00:00:21.499 --> 00:00:27.803
"We might be too heavy for the plane," Oliver said.

6
00:00:27.804 --> 00:00:32.341
"We are not too heavy," Mom said.

7
00:00:32.342 --> 00:00:37.040
The plane took off.

8
00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:43.352
The Carter Family was flying!

9
00:00:43.353 --> 00:00:47.290
"My ears hurt!" Oliver said.

10
00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:53.610
Mom gave Oliver a piece of gum.

11
00:00:53.611 --> 00:00:59.322
Chewing the gum made his ears feel better.

12
00:00:59.323 --> 00:01:05.636
Oliver looked out the window.

13
00:01:05.637 --> 00:01:10.031
"We are very high up!" he said.

14
00:01:10.032 --> 00:01:13.122
"What if we fall?"

15
00:01:13.123 --> 00:01:22.041
Harry said, "We will not fall."

16
00:01:22.042 --> 00:01:33.055
Mom gave the kids a card game.

17
00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:42.030
"Oliver can go first," Emmy said.

18
00:01:42.031 --> 00:01:45.336
Oliver won the game.

19
00:01:45.337 --> 00:01:49.339
"That was fun," he said.

20
00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:55.716
A flight attendant brought drinks and a snack.

21
00:01:55.717 --> 00:02:00.099
"Yum," said Oliver.

22
00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:04.567
"I love pretzels and juice."

23
00:02:04.568 --> 00:02:08.178
The plane landed.

24
00:02:08.179 --> 00:02:12.785
Everyone got their luggage.

25
00:02:12.786 --> 00:02:18.702
The flight attendant smiled at Oliver.

26
00:02:18.703 --> 00:02:22.406
"Would you like to meet the pilot?" she asked.

27
00:02:22.407 --> 00:02:26.429
"Yes!" Oliver said.

28
00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:29.972
The pilot had a cool uniform.

29
00:02:29.973 --> 00:02:33.687
He showed Oliver the cockpit.

30
00:02:33.688 --> 00:02:38.388
Oliver saw buttons and lights and maps.

31
00:02:38.389 --> 00:02:44.211
"Wow!" Oliver said.

32
00:02:44.212 --> 00:02:49.292
"Does flying still seem scary, Oliver?" Dad asked.

33
00:02:49.293 --> 00:02:52.948
"Scary?" Oliver laughed.

34
00:02:52.949 --> 00:02:56.567
"Flying is not scary, Dad!

35
00:02:56.568 --> 00:03:03.184
Flying is awesome!"

